Changes made by this fork (2026, Projects / projects.gg):
  - Branding: application name and id (gg.projects.mobile), launcher icon, splash screen,
    colors and fonts.
  - Projects integration: Ed25519-verified news from the Projects content index, the
    "Projects'e katil" join flow (Projects profile, official pack sync, server list entry and
    auto-join of play.projects.gg), and the mod screen for the official pack's optional mods.
  - Friends and crews (0.2.0): Discord sign-in to the Projects friends service, friends and
    crews with live status, and phone notifications through Firebase Cloud Messaging. The
    Firebase configuration is not part of the source; builds without it have no notifications.
  The full list of changes is the git history of the "projects" branch on top of upstream.

